cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CUDA Kernel Library"
abstract: >-
  A hand written CUDA linear algebra library taken from a naive GEMM to a
  compute bound tensor core kernel on a single NVIDIA RTX 5070, with every
  performance claim measured against the vendor library on the same GPU in the
  same process.
